Skia without its RAW codec (ADR-0043 a1).

The host flavor's Skia decodes RAW images through dng_sdk and piex, which Minato does not fetch (3 MB, and Android's
BitmapFactory decodes no RAW either); hwui-plan.py leaves SkRawCodec.cpp and both libraries out, and the config stops
asking for the codec.

--- a/external/skia/linux/include/config/SkUserConfig.h
+++ b/external/skia/linux/include/config/SkUserConfig.h
@@ -23,10 +23,6 @@
 #define SK_CODEC_DECODES_PNG
 #endif
 
-#ifndef SK_CODEC_DECODES_RAW
-#define SK_CODEC_DECODES_RAW
-#endif
-
 #ifndef SK_CODEC_DECODES_WBMP
 #define SK_CODEC_DECODES_WBMP
 #endif
